From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 22:18:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(financial): expose paymentEnvironment in wallet config
 response
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

O CI estava falhando em withdrawal-provider-rejection-recovery.test.ts:
o handler já calculava isStrictAsaasSandbox() e o PrizeWallet.tsx já
sabia exibir o aviso de Ambiente Asaas Sandbox, mas o campo
config.paymentEnvironment nunca era incluído na resposta do GET
/api/financial, então o frontend nunca recebia o sinal para mostrar
o aviso.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GJxr5k2q4nCkbZphek1rFs
---
 api/_handlers/financial.ts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/api/_handlers/financial.ts b/api/_handlers/financial.ts
index 9523086..35adfdb 100644
--- a/api/_handlers/financial.ts
+++ b/api/_handlers/financial.ts
@@ -279,6 +279,7 @@ export default async function handler(req: VercelRequest, res: VercelResponse) {
           minWithdrawalAmount: money(config.minWithdrawalAmount),
           maxDailyWithdrawalAmount: money(config.maxDailyWithdrawalAmount),
           identityCheckEnabled: ENFORCE_IDENTITY_FOR_WITHDRAWAL,
+          paymentEnvironment: isStrictAsaasSandbox() ? 'sandbox' : 'production',
         },
         identity: identityPayload(identity),
         cashSource: 'official_prizes_only',
